                            🚛

                        </div>

                        <div>

                            <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark rounded-pill">
                                Step 06
                            </span>

                            <h5 class="fw-bold mt-2 mb-0">
                                Food Delivered
                            </h5>

                        </div>

                    </div>

                    <p class="text-muted mt-3 mb-0">
                        The delivery person transports the food
                        and delivers it to the requesting NGO.
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>


    </div>


    <!-- =====================================
         FINAL MESSAGE
    ====================================== -->

    <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 mt-5">

        <div class="card-body text-center p-5">

            <div style="font-size: 3rem;">
                ❤️
            </div>

            <h3 class="fw-bold mt-3">
                Together We Reduce Food Waste
            </h3>

            <p class="text-muted mx-auto mb-0"
               style="max-width: 650px;">

                NextBite helps transform surplus food into
                meaningful support for communities by connecting
                every step of the redistribution process.

            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</div>
